sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as gunicorn
    participant A as app.py
    participant S as setup_resource
    participant M as LeaseManager
    participant T as Hilos de fondo

    G->>A: import app
    Note right of A: logs JSON · configuración · Flask · JWT<br/>modelos · LR.conectar() (loop MQTT)
    A->>S: setup_resource(app, LabRemDriver(LR), ...)
    Note right of S: 1. lock de proceso único<br/>(si otro proceso lo tiene: ProcessLockError)<br/>2. crea HardwareController, HistoryRecorder<br/>y LeaseManager · registra endpoints
    S->>T: inicia lease-history (cierra sesiones huérfanas)
    S->>M: start(initial_reset=True)
    Note right of M: estado RESETTING
    M->>T: inicia lease-startup-reset y lease-watchdog
    Note right of S: registra apagado ordenado (atexit)
    A-->>G: aplicación lista
    T-->>M: safe_state OK → FREE (o FAULT)
